<title>ITALY: DHL signs Italian deal with Femar.</title>
<headline>DHL signs Italian deal with Femar.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>DHL International has signed an agreement with Femar spa, Catania for transporting cargo and documents.</p>
<p>A Fokker 27 all-cargo plane with cargo capacity of 5.2 tonnes will be used on the Bergamo to Catania route calling at Alghero which returns to Bergamo via Ancona.</p>
<p>The new service will cover Sicily and Sardinia as welll as Marche and Remini provinces.</p>
<p>DHL has been operating in Italy since 1978.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
